<title>USA: Mitchell Bancorp sets $0.20 cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Mitchell Bancorp sets $0.20 cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SPRUCE PINE, N.C. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitchell Bancorp Inc said Thursday its board has declared an initial $0.20 a share semi-annual cash dividend on outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The initial dividend is payable on February 24 to shareholders of record as of February 10, the bankholding company said.</p>
<p>Mitchell is the parent of Mitchell Savings Bank Inc, a North Carolina-chartered savings bank.</p>
